WEBVTT

00:13:25.759 --> 00:13:30.305
Again, the most impressive architecture
is not temples and palaces.

00:13:30.305 --> 00:13:34.351
It's just the well-appointed residences
of ordinary citizens

00:13:34.351 --> 00:13:40.649
arrayed along these grand terraces
overlooking district plazas.

00:13:41.316 --> 00:13:43.819
And it's not just the history of cities

00:13:43.861 --> 00:13:48.532
that modern archaeological science
is turning on its head.

00:13:49.491 --> 00:13:52.286
We also know now that the history
of human societies

00:13:52.327 --> 00:13:54.121
before the coming of agriculture

00:13:54.162 --> 00:13:56.915
is just nothing
like what we once imagined.

00:13:57.833 --> 00:14:00.419
Far from this idea of people
living all the time